'''Gish''' is a [[boss]] that can appear in the {{s|Depths}} and the {{s|Dank Depths}}.

== Behavior ==
* Makes short hops towards Isaac, similar to {{e|Monstro}}.
* Fires a black {{i|Ipecac}} shot towards Isaac, leaving a large puddle of [[Creep#Black Creep|Black Creep]] on impact.
* Leaps off-screen and lands on Isaac's position twice in a row, similar to {{e|Monstro II}}.
** Leaves a large puddle of Black Creep on his first landing.
*** The Black Creep spawned by Gish's first jump will remain for the entire battle until Gish is killed.
** Spawns two {{e|Clot}}s on his second landing.
*** There is a maximum of 2 Clots alive at once.
*** Gish deals a full heart of contact damage.

== Notes ==
* {{Dlc|r}} While just as common as other bosses in the Dank Depths' boss pool, Gish is only 1/4th as common as other {{R|Boss Room}} bosses in The Depths.
** Gish is the only boss to have more than 1 boss weight besides {{e|The Matriarch}}.
* Gish will often be accompanied by {{e|Clot}}s.

