== Trivia ==
* Gish appeared in the original ''The Binding of Isaac''.
* He is a rare alternative to Monstro II.
* The item {{I|Ball of Tar}} gives Isaac a Gish-like appearance.
* The enemy Clots are tiny Gishes.
* Gish is the protagonist of the 2004 PC game ''[http://store.steampowered.com/app/9500/ Gish]'', created by Edmund McMillen.
* Gish is the only boss to be an alternate version of a posthumous boss, being Monstro II's alternative.
* {{dlc+|a+}} Gish can be found in {{s|The Void}}, even before being unlocked.{{dlc-}}

